65585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-19T15:49:45Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T15:21:41Z","closed_at":"2026-09-22T15:21:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123642","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123642","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123642.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123642.patch","merged_at":"2026-09-22T15:21:21Z"},"body":"In Godot 4, WebXR requires the WebXR Layers API which isn't implemented on all web browsers, so we've always recommended developers to use the [polyfill](https://github.com/immersive-web/webxr-layers-polyfill).\r\n\r\nThis made sense when we first implemented it, because I figured all browsers would probably implement WebXR Layers pretty soon anyway. Well, there's still lots of browsers that haven't, and even worse, some browsers (like the Pico browser) have broken implementations of it, which even the polyfill can't fix\r\n\r\nSo, this PR makes it so that our WebXR support can work without the WebXR Layers API (there's another code path that will be used instead), and allows setting `WebXRInterface.disable_webxr_layers = true` to disable using it even if it's supported (so developers can work around the broken implementations)\r\n\r\nThis also makes WebXR a little easier to use in Godot, because remembering to add the WebXR Layers polyfill is one less thing for developers to do\r\n\r\n**Note 1:** There is a performance advantage to using WebXR Layers if the browser supports multiview, so it's still the path we take by default\r\n\r\n**Note 2:** This brings back some code from Godot 3: the [shader and associated code](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8e352c9a462ec75ecbdde204f223768dcefd0f96/modules/webxr/native/library_godot_webxr.js#L79) for blitting from Godot's render target to the framebuffer from WebXR","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123642/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123642/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}